    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cba892c4a3835046f65be9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跨越了诸多历史的，\n那个京都赛场的终点板钥匙圈\n……呵呵，买到好东西了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5c547569516994a70ecc0ca8c7603eaccb75b2347a134c973a489197bb0662",
