      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5ea7aaa2f9a7eccfb1ed3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……今、今天……\n在房间里研究赛跑史……之类的，\n您看怎么样……?",
