      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c21174b4e401d2616d27ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据『创世方略』来看……\n虽然今天好像建议休养……\n但是不行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "96f9efcd083e15b5a0665b212d82b558a10611dc45acbec0a175cb1c39bb7a20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee08cdb5c5c22ac52ada64a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心里莫名沸腾起来了……！\n呵呵，现在接受采访的话……\n说不定会口出狂言呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1982a7243272370b34917e78d234fd16e488b2d4627dc90576653704be33ed6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bef825d0874e0098b61c58e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天这一步，也会是\n创造历史的一步……！\n有一种……这样的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "822654a53b7036d96012ac54d5a3a07d32b8b876c57d175d8a2d1dad78ccaf64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1485459c61c623ad86eff5bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日常的积累……\n总有一天会造就历史。\n今天还请多多指教。",
