      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:612bbecb5a8dc7d7736cf492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了今天能努力打起精神……\n我把历史性GⅠ比赛时买的毛巾\n拿来了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81799507bc86a2022e42348f905dbfd6d41bfa46b581dba4439ec76fc7822bd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:799ebcb27db679aa27ebdd3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天的奔跑都会有新发现……\n『创世方略』随时更新中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ddbb7409f4ff8ce1488108c307173f954db816d4f787dda97d9cb00837643c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20006"
